  <tag k="inscription" v="1788 - 1963&#10;&#10;The 175th anniversary of the foundation by governor Arthur Phillip of the first settlement in Australia on the shores of Sydney Cove on the 26th January, 1788 was marked by the planting of three trees on the 26th January, 1963."/>
